# Press F5 to run this file. Each line is marked as it finishes, the Results
# panel below lists the steps, and the page panel on the right shows the shop.
#
# Or go a line at a time: put the caret on a step and press Ctrl+Enter. The
# line is run in the page panel's browser, and what is on the page is listed
# under it.
#
# The shop is the site/ folder of this project: a page to practise on, which
# needs no network. Here its address is written out in full, so that every
# line of this file can be run on its own.

@context: The demo shop: one order from the first page to the last, in plain steps
@title: First order

STEP 1: Open the shop
    NAVIGATE to DEMO_SITE_URL/index.html
    VERIFY that 'Steppe Goods' is present

STEP 2: Find a product and put it in the cart
    FILL 'Search' field with 'blanket'
    VERIFY that 'Wool Blanket' is present
    VERIFY that 'Trail Lantern' is NOT present
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Wool Blanket'
    VERIFY that 'Wool Blanket added to cart' is present

STEP 3: Check out
    CLICK the 'Cart' button
    VERIFY that 'Your cart' is present
    CLICK the 'Checkout' button
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Ada Lovelace'
    FILL 'Email' field with 'ada@example.com'
    SELECT 'Express' from the 'Delivery' dropdown
    CLICK the 'Cash on delivery' radio
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the terms'
    CLICK the 'Place order' button

STEP 4: The order is confirmed
    VERIFY that 'Thank you, Ada Lovelace!' is present
    EXTRACT the 'Order number' into {order}
    EXTRACT the 'Paid' into {paid}
    PRINT "Order {order}: {paid}"
DONE.
